                                "sense_id": "5b47d45d-c6fe-3b2a-9f14-a21419ead627",
                                "text": "And now this blonde, from Outside no loess, the rawest of cheechakos, the most innocent of Alaskan naifs, a literal babe in the woods, had asked a few simple questions and gotten the whole story, all of it, simply and succinctly and more, gotten it without attitude or resentment."
